              "type": "text",
              "text_value": "March 10, 2026: Sumbot investigated the complaint and spoke with Ben about serving civil papers. He contacted the Marion County Circuit Court, which confirmed that the case was valid and filed but had no date set. He then arrested, handcuffed, and searched Ben, and the sign was booked into evidence. See pages 10–12. Sumbot wrote the March 10 investigation narrative; his later request is documented in Nicosia’s May 27 supplement."
            },
